{
    "title": "Taimi - LGBTQ+ Dating & Chat",
    "description": "<b>What if you have been searching for love in the wrong places? Then it\u2019s time to find Taimi, one of the biggest LGBTQ+ dating apps for adults (+18)</b>\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\r\n\r\nAll-Inclusive Fluid Online Dating Platform has everything for all colors and shades of the rainbow. Looking for the right network, awesome events, love story, LGBT+ dating? A transgender person looking for a bisexual or another trans person? Maybe you need polyamorous dating? Set up your gaydar! Come, download and get joy here! \r\n\r\nGuys, women, girls, men. No, there are more genders! \r\nBy questioning our sexuality we become who we truly are. You may never be done figuring out your mutuals and that\u2019s okay.\r\nLesbians, poly people\u2026 Welcome to our app! Meet people, become friends or something more\u2026 Share your photos, like, swipe down to know your potential mutuals more!\r\n\r\nOthers are looking for you on Taimi, the best of all LGBT+ free dating app  \u2013 gay dating app, bisexual dating app, queer dating, transgender dating, lesbian dating, poly dating or any other as you wish. And whether you prefer long-distance or local dating mutuals, casual dating, friendship, or a long-term partnership, including making couples - it\u2019s all here.\r\n\r\nLive to the fullest, meet new people, play love games on our app!\r\n\r\nIn short, the entire LGBTQ+ community will find that Taimi is one of the best of all online dating apps for free.\r\n \r\n<b>It's All About the Cards</b>\ud83d\udcf2\r\nUse Taimi Cards to craft your own profile and to see others. These let you choose the content you share \u2013 photos, text posts & answers to prompt questions and to see the cards of potential mutuals. Use these cards to take an action \u2013 Skip a profile, give a simple Like, or a special Rainbow Like to show keen interest.\r\n \r\n<b>Discover Yourself</b>\ud83e\ude9e\r\nWe honor all Fluid Dating Preferences Users. Who you are today may not be who you are next week. It's the path of our commitment to \u201cdiscovery.\u201d You may be an asexual looking for friendship. Any gender and sexual identity are here on Taimi.\r\n \r\n \r\n\ud83c\udd93 Here\u2019s all you get with our LGBT dating app for free:\r\n- Look through Taimi Cards and choose all the possible mutuals \u2013 smash or pass anywhere on the planet or stay local with a \u201cnear me\u201d filter.\r\n- Find real and vetted local mutuals\r\n- Get mutuals based on your rainbow shade \u2013 fem or butch, bi, trans, asexual, polyamorous, and everything in between\r\n- Share your age, location, and more \u2013 secure account with PIN, Face Recognition, Fingerprint\r\n- Have a free chat, facetime with mutuals, and record audio messages\r\n- Find local mutuals when you travel\r\n \r\n \r\nBut wait! Join one of three Taimi premium account levels and get more with BRONZE, SILVER\ud83e\udd48 or GOLD\ud83c\udfc6\r\n \r\nWhat more, you ask? For starters:\r\n- Get unlimited direct meetups and dating\r\n- Boost profile surging it up to 5X\r\n- Extend filters for results\r\n- Undo mistakes\r\n- See all visitors and much more!\r\n \r\nCheck out more details about OUR PRIDE at Taimi.com and these links:\r\nhttps://taimi.com/wiki\r\nhttps://taimi.com/terms\r\nhttps://taimi.com/privacy-policy\r\nsupport@taimi.com\r\n \r\n<b>And don't forget to join us on Social Media:</b>\r\nTikTok: @taimiapp\r\nInstagram: @taimiapp\r\nTwitter: @taimiapp\r\nFacebook: @taimiapp\r\nYoutube: @taimiapp\r\nPinterest: @taimiapp\r\nMedium: you won't believe it, but it's @taimiapp\r\n\r\nEveryone at least once makes a wish, \u201cmeet me, flirt me, date me, my soulmate\u201d.  And you? Have you already found someone? Find friends, a local meetup, a partner, a soulmate, or a lifelong love relationship on Taimi\u2763\ufe0f\r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s coming next?\r\nWe\u2019ll keep adding features, fixing bugs, watering our plants, and serving our whole lovely community.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>What if you have been searching for love in the wrong places? Then it\u2019s time to find Taimi, one of the biggest LGBTQ+ dating apps for adults (+18)</b>\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8<br><br>All-Inclusive Fluid Online Dating Platform has everything for all colors and shades of the rainbow. Looking for the right network, awesome events, love story, LGBT+ dating? A transgender person looking for a bisexual or another trans person? Maybe you need polyamorous dating? Set up your gaydar! Come, download and get joy here! <br><br>Guys, women, girls, men. No, there are more genders! <br>By questioning our sexuality we become who we truly are. You may never be done figuring out your mutuals and that\u2019s okay.<br>Lesbians, poly people\u2026 Welcome to our app! Meet people, become friends or something more\u2026 Share your photos, like, swipe down to know your potential mutuals more!<br><br>Others are looking for you on Taimi, the best of all LGBT+ free dating app  \u2013 gay dating app, bisexual dating app, queer dating, transgender dating, lesbian dating, poly dating or any other as you wish. And whether you prefer long-distance or local dating mutuals, casual dating, friendship, or a long-term partnership, including making couples - it\u2019s all here.<br><br>Live to the fullest, meet new people, play love games on our app!<br><br>In short, the entire LGBTQ+ community will find that Taimi is one of the best of all online dating apps for free.<br> <br><b>It&#39;s All About the Cards</b>\ud83d\udcf2<br>Use Taimi Cards to craft your own profile and to see others. These let you choose the content you share \u2013 photos, text posts &amp; answers to prompt questions and to see the cards of potential mutuals. Use these cards to take an action \u2013 Skip a profile, give a simple Like, or a special Rainbow Like to show keen interest.<br> <br><b>Discover Yourself</b>\ud83e\ude9e<br>We honor all Fluid Dating Preferences Users. Who you are today may not be who you are next week. It&#39;s the path of our commitment to \u201cdiscovery.\u201d You may be an asexual looking for friendship. Any gender and sexual identity are here on Taimi.<br> <br> <br>\ud83c\udd93 Here\u2019s all you get with our LGBT dating app for free:<br>- Look through Taimi Cards and choose all the possible mutuals \u2013 smash or pass anywhere on the planet or stay local with a \u201cnear me\u201d filter.<br>- Find real and vetted local mutuals<br>- Get mutuals based on your rainbow shade \u2013 fem or butch, bi, trans, asexual, polyamorous, and everything in between<br>- Share your age, location, and more \u2013 secure account with PIN, Face Recognition, Fingerprint<br>- Have a free chat, facetime with mutuals, and record audio messages<br>- Find local mutuals when you travel<br> <br> <br>But wait! Join one of three Taimi premium account levels and get more with BRONZE, SILVER\ud83e\udd48 or GOLD\ud83c\udfc6<br> <br>What more, you ask? For starters:<br>- Get unlimited direct meetups and dating<br>- Boost profile surging it up to 5X<br>- Extend filters for results<br>- Undo mistakes<br>- See all visitors and much more!<br> <br>Check out more details about OUR PRIDE at Taimi.com and these links:<br>https://taimi.com/wiki<br>https://taimi.com/terms<br>https://taimi.com/privacy-policy<br>support@taimi.com<br> <br><b>And don&#39;t forget to join us on Social Media:</b><br>TikTok: @taimiapp<br>Instagram: @taimiapp<br>Twitter: @taimiapp<br>Facebook: @taimiapp<br>Youtube: @taimiapp<br>Pinterest: @taimiapp<br>Medium: you won&#39;t believe it, but it&#39;s @taimiapp<br><br>Everyone at least once makes a wish, \u201cmeet me, flirt me, date me, my soulmate\u201d.  And you? Have you already found someone? Find friends, a local meetup, a partner, a soulmate, or a lifelong love relationship on Taimi\u2763\ufe0f<br><br>What\u2019s coming next?<br>We\u2019ll keep adding features, fixing bugs, watering our plants, and serving our whole lovely community.",
